---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: The fixers run on main every week
    accDescr: Each week, Lint and the CI run on main by their schedule, or by hand where bot health starts a schedule that GitHub missed. When every check passes, the week was quiet, with no job of the fix bot, no pull request and no issue. When a check fails and a command fixes what it found, the fix bot keeps one pull request from bot/self-heal, which merges itself, so that main is healed before the next pull request. When no command fixes it, bot health keeps one issue open until a run passes.

    week(["Each week, on main"])
    checks["Lint and the CI run by their schedule, or by hand<br>where bot health starts one that GitHub missed"]
    passed{"Does every<br>check pass?"}
    quiet(["A quiet week: no job of the fix bot,<br>no pull request and no issue"])
    command{"Does a command<br>fix what it found?"}
    heal["The fix bot keeps one pull request<br>from bot/self-heal, which merges itself"]
    healed(["main is healed before<br>the next pull request"])
    issue["Bot health keeps one issue open<br>until a run passes"]

    week --> checks --> passed
    passed -- "yes" --> quiet
    passed -- "no" --> command
    command -- "yes" --> heal --> healed
    command -- "no" --> issue

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class week,checks,heal bot
    class issue person
    class quiet,healed done
